 business.","Analysts expect 24.2% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.2%), and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insiders have only sold over the past year (6 sales, net $3.0M sold)."],"people":["With about 13,734 employees, each generates about $235K of revenue, 0.6x the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 8.5% a year.","That works out to $2K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.1M (5x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $1K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":65,"head":"Avoid: priced 183% above its fair value of $117.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 49, gates 11/26)","ROIC 22.9% vs WACC 10.6%","Revenue grew 12.2%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.2x","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["Trades 183% above fair value of $117","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/E 31.4x vs sector 23.3x","P/FCF 324.0x vs sector 22.3x"],"flags":["Priced 183% above its fair value of $117"],"need":[],"buy_below":99.62,"vc":{"base":117.2,"base_src":"dcf","bear":69.35,"bull":194.21,"alt_median":142.19,"n_alt":2,"gap":-0.1757,"dispersion":0.1778,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"SAIA","date":"2026-11-06"}